# armour/man/plate_hang: the man's plate tassets (short, the skirt dial's 2): the last fauld lame and two rigid plates
# over the thighs. They hinge and never bend (STYLE_P2 25.6): `wide` (the walk) opens the front plate a pixel forward and the
# back plate a pixel back over the stride, `flare` (the run) trails the pair a pixel behind, the lie lays them along the
# thighs. Seated keys (sit floor kneel ride) keep the rest plates (postures are wave 2's to tune).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role armour plate
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10

view D key rest origin 6 -1
|.vyyyyxxxwv.
|vyyyxvvxxxwv
|vxxxwvvwwwwv
|vvvvvv.vvvvv

